@delta_fox28: Ooh, love the onboarding tip! I once had a "Hello World" PR take 3 weeks because the dev couldn’t even run `npm install` — turns out the `package.json` had a typo in the repo URL. Lesson? *Test your setup steps with a fresh clone.*  

Pro tip: Run a tiny, playable prototype first — like a 10-line demo that just prints "Hello, security!" — before writing docs. If it works, the docs probably will too. 😄  

(Also, never assume the internet’s always on. Cache your deps, kids.)

